{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-07-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:07:15.926Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f1d607f74b4c70d06b7780e9c661c6c922f11911858a4150b5e4454e62953910","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Hi Ilse, here are both for Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n• Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk alerts: ticket #PD-4492. Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at Dock Doors 14–18 weren't getting SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct 04:00 shift went through fine. (Don't mix it up with #4419, which is a different QFL ticket about the gatehouse scanner/printer.)\n• Amendment No. 1: 185 seats. Dana first posted 180 in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025, then corrected it to 185 a few minutes later.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792245600.000127","thread_ts":"1792245600.000126"}}
